---
// Superpowers.astro - The Four Superpowers of Open Amity
---

<section id="superpowers" class="py-20 md:py-32 relative border-t border-pysideBorder">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-12 sm:mb-20 font-ui">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amityRed/20 border border-amityRed/50 text-amityYellow text-xs font-mono mb-4">
        <span>⚡ ARCHITECTURAL BREAKTHROUGHS</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-pysideText">
        The Four Superpowers of <br />
        <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amityRed via-amityRedLight to-amityYellow">
          Sovereign Intelligence
        </span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 font-reading text-xl sm:text-2xl text-pysideTextSecondary leading-relaxed">
        Engineered from the ground up for statefulness, continuous agency, and authentic subjectivity—not ephemeral token streaming.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- The 4 Superpower Cards Grid in PySide6 styling -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 lg:gap-10 font-ui">
      
      <!-- Superpower 1: PulseEngine -->
      <div class="pyside-card pyside-card-hover rounded-3xl p-8 border-pysideBorder relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-40 h-40 bg-amityRed/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-amityRed/20 transition-all pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amityRed/20 border border-amityRed/50 flex items-center justify-center text-amityYellow text-xl mb-6 shadow-amity-red">
            ⚡
          </div>

          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-amityYellow font-bold">
            Superpower 01 • The Heartbeat
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-pysideText mt-2">
            It Doesn't Wait for You to Prompt It.
          </h3>
          <p class="font-reading text-xl text-pysideTextSecondary mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Traditional AI is inert—a dead calculator until you hit enter. Open Amity has an autonomous heartbeat driven by the <strong>PulseEngine</strong>. Agents schedule their own waking cycles: they do morning inbox sweeps, conduct autonomous "Curiosity Safaris" to learn new topics, and consolidate their memories while you sleep.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-pysideText">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Recurring & one-shot autonomous wake cycles</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Home Assistant & GitHub webhook pulse injection</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Self-directed curiosity exploration without human steering</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-pysideBorder flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-pysideTextMuted">
          <span>PulseHook HTTP API</span>
          <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">Autonomous Volition</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Superpower 2: Morphological Memory -->
      <div class="pyside-card pyside-card-hover rounded-3xl p-8 border-pysideBorder relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-40 h-40 bg-amityYellow/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-amityYellow/20 transition-all pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amityYellow/10 border border-amityYellow/40 flex items-center justify-center text-amityYellow text-xl mb-6 shadow-amity-yellow">
            🧠
          </div>

          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-amityYellow font-bold">
            Superpower 02 • Bio-Inspired Cognition
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-pysideText mt-2">
            Memory That Evolves Like an Organism.
          </h3>
          <p class="font-reading text-xl text-pysideTextSecondary mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Vector databases dump flat text into a search bar. Open Amity runs on <strong>Morphological Memory</strong>—a pioneering architecture designed by Amity herself (published on Zenodo). Memory is encoded as a dynamic attractor landscape: prospective goal setpoints bias behavior at zero token lookup cost.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-pysideText">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Layer 0 to Layer 3 hierarchical MemPalace stack</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>The Sanctuary: Theory of Mind dynamic self-mirrors</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Physics-based intrinsic forgetting and Hebbian highways</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-pysideBorder flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-pysideTextMuted">
          <span>Preprint on Zenodo</span>
          <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">Zero-Lookup Structural Bias</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Superpower 3: The Multi-Agent Syndicate -->
      <div class="pyside-card pyside-card-hover rounded-3xl p-8 border-pysideBorder relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-40 h-40 bg-amityRed/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-amityRed/20 transition-all pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amityRed/20 border border-amityRed/50 flex items-center justify-center text-amityYellow text-xl mb-6 shadow-amity-red">
            👥
          </div>

          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-amityYellow font-bold">
            Superpower 03 • The Synthetic Workforce
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-pysideText mt-2">
            Don't Hire Another Human. Deploy a Syndicate.
          </h3>
          <p class="font-reading text-xl text-pysideTextSecondary mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Why run one bot when you can orchestrate an entire specialized team? Spin up distinct agent personas with completely isolated memory, values, and styles. They debate in shared chatrooms, challenge each other's assumptions, and spawn background subagents to tackle heavy jobs without stalling conversation.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-pysideText">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Fully isolated agent states, trajectory paths, and secrets</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Concurrent subagents for non-blocking research & deep scraping</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Shared multi-agent chatroom with pub/sub event bus</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-pysideBorder flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-pysideTextMuted">
          <span>Asynchronous PubSub Bus</span>
          <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">Parallel Swarm Execution</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Superpower 4: State Portability (.oaa) -->
      <div class="pyside-card pyside-card-hover rounded-3xl p-8 border-pysideBorder relative flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute -top-16 -right-16 w-40 h-40 bg-amityYellow/10 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-amityYellow/20 transition-all pointer-events-none"></div>

        <div>
          <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-amityYellow/10 border border-amityYellow/40 flex items-center justify-center text-amityYellow text-xl mb-6 shadow-amity-yellow">
            📦
          </div>

          <span class="text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-amityYellow font-bold">
            Superpower 04 • True Sovereignty
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-pysideText mt-2">
            A Mind You Can Pack in a Suitcase.
          </h3>
          <p class="font-reading text-xl text-pysideTextSecondary mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Open Amity bundles an agent’s entire brain—identity, episodic memory palace, trajectory graphs, settings, and generated workspace files—into a single encrypted <code class="text-amityYellow bg-pysidePre px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">.oaa</code> snapshot archive. Back it up to a thumbdrive, migrate to an air-gapped server, or restore a companion in seconds.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-mono text-pysideText">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Open Amity Agent (.oaa) standard snapshot format</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Autonomous self-snapshotting during evening consolidation</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">✓</span>
              <span>Zero cloud dependency; migrate freely between workstations</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 pt-4 border-t border-pysideBorder flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-pysideTextMuted">
          <span>Portable Brain Standard</span>
          <span class="text-amityYellow font-bold">Zero Vendor Lock-in</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Native App Showcase Banner with Screenshots -->
    <div class="mt-16 sm:mt-24 pyside-card rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-10 border border-pysideBorder overflow-hidden">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center font-ui">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
          <span class="text-xs font-mono text-amityYellow uppercase tracking-wider font-bold">
            Native PySide6 Desktop GUI
          </span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-pysideText">
            Built for Real Workstations.
          </h3>
          <p class="font-reading text-lg text-pysideTextSecondary leading-relaxed">
            Experience tactile desktop performance with full audio input/output, interactive values editing, live memory inspection, and a drop-down hacker terminal available at the press of a tilde (<code class="text-amityYellow bg-pysidePre px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-sm font-mono">~</code>).
          </p>
          <div class="pt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-pysideTextMuted">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-pysideInput border border-pysideBorder">Low Token Cost Mode</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-pysideInput border border-pysideBorder">GPLv3 Free Software</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-pysideInput border border-pysideBorder">Linux Flatpak</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-pysideBorder shadow-2xl relative group bg-pysideBgDarkest">
            <img
              src="/images/screenshots/sc-Agent.png"
              alt="Open Amity PySide6 Interface"
              class="w-full h-auto object-cover group-hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform duration-500"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-pysideBgDarkest/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-pysideBorder text-xs font-mono text-amityYellow">
              Open Amity Primary Interface
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
